        "original_id": "da9ef82d-8820-5278-84c3-eab422ce02bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlize Theron, Aileen Wuornos, Christina Ricci, Selby Wall, Tyria Moore\n- Works: Monster (2003 film)\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress, Golden Globe Award for Best Actress in a Motion Picture – Drama, Screen Actors Guild Award for Outstanding Performance by a Female Actor in a Leading Role\n- Topics: film casting, award recognition\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2003 crime drama film Monster, Charlize Theron portrayed serial killer Aileen Wuornos.\n- In Monster, Christina Ricci played Selby Wall, a semi-fictionalized lover based on Aileen Wuornos's real-life girlfriend Tyria Moore.\n- For her portrayal of Aileen Wuornos in Monster, Charlize Theron received the Academy Award for Best Actress.\n- For her portrayal of Aileen Wuornos in Monster, Charlize Theron received the Golden Globe Award for Best Actress in a Motion Picture – Drama.\n- For her portrayal of Aileen Wuornos in Monster, Charlize Theron received the Screen Actors Guild Award for Outstanding Performance by a Female Actor in a Leading Role.",
